宋"}},{"title":"黄兵部生辰四首 其一","author":"陈渊","text":"中朝人物竞推先，富贵前途看永年。\n九万里程飞正远，八千春干久弥坚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27344,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄兵部生辰四首 其三","author":"陈渊","text":"蚤岁飞荣应宿郎，至今鸡舌尚含香。\n未应驷马誇流俗，只为慈亲乐故乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27345,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄兵部生辰四首 其二","author":"陈渊","text":"南国初持使节回，斑衣仍把锦新裁。\n大椿更向萱堂祝，长到春来共寿杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27346,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]